 ## Ratified next
 
+### CoreV2 framework branch
+
+**Implemented on `codex/corev2-framework`.** CoreV2 now has an isolated typed framework,
+deterministic Orleans TestCluster proof module, and acceptance coverage for its activity,
+capability, graph, delivery, wiring, privacy, retry, and policy invariants. It intentionally keeps
+provider schemas, raw graph controls, and adapter-specific JSON out of the framework.
+
+**Known limitation.** The final CI/documentation hardening task remains pending, and CoreV2 has not
+yet replaced V1 product hosting, Flutter, MCP transport, provider integration, or billing.
+See [CoreV2 framework](/architecture/corev2).
+
